  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ロボットに　こいした　サザンドラのこどもと　オカルトざっしがとりあげた　ポケモンに　にている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "로봇과 사랑에 빠진 삼삼드래의 자식이라며 오컬트 잡지에서 다뤘던 포켓몬을 닮았다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "牠與超自然雜誌曾報導過的寶可夢很相似。報導中的寶可夢是愛上機器人的三首惡龍所生的孩子。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il ressemble à un Pokémon qui serait l’enfant d’un Trioxhydre amoureux d’un robot, selon une revue consacrée aux phénomènes paranormaux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ähnelt einem Pokémon, das einer esoterischen Zeitschrift nach der Nachwuchs eines Trikephalo sein soll, welches sich in einen Roboter verliebte.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se asemeja a un Pokémon que apareció en una revista esotérica descrito como \"el fruto de un romance entre un Hydreigon y un robot\".",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Somiglia a un Pokémon presentato da una rivista di paranormale come il frutto dell’amore tra un Hydreigon e un robot.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It resembles a certain Pokémon introduced in a paranormal magazine, described as the offspring of a Hydreigon that fell in love with a robot.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ロボットに　恋した　サザンドラの子どもと　オカルト雑誌が取り上げた　ポケモンに　似ている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "它与超自然杂志曾报道过的宝可梦很相似。报道中的宝可梦是爱上机器人的三首恶龙所生的孩子。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se asemeja a un Pokémon que apareció en una revista esotérica descrito como \"el fruto de un romance entre un Hydreigon y un robot\".",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふるい　しょもつに　しるされたテツノコウベという　ぶったいはこのポケモンかも　しれない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "오래된 서적에 기록된 “무쇠머리”라는 물체는 이 포켓몬을 말하는 것일지도 모른다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "古書裡所記載的叫做鐵脖頸的物體，說不定就是這隻寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon pourrait être l’entité évoquée dans un livre ancien sous le nom de « Têtes-de-Fer ».",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Womöglich handelt es sich bei diesem Pokémon um ein Objekt namens Eisenhals, das in einer alten Schrift beschrieben wurde.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es posible que se trate de Ferrocuello, un objeto mencionado en unos viejos escritos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Questo Pokémon potrebbe essere l’oggetto descritto in un antico testo con il nome di \"Colloferreo\".",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It’s possible that Iron Jugulis, an object described in an old book, may actually be this Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "古い　書物に　記されたテツノコウベという　物体はこのポケモンかも　しれない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "古老的书籍中所记载的叫做铁脖颈的物体说不定就是这只宝可梦。",
      "language": {
